hadiths[68]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1720","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah taala ko do qatron aur do nishaniyon sey ziyada koi chiz mehbub nahin hai : aansu ka eik qatra jo Allah key khof ki wajeh sey nikley aur doosra khoon ka wo qatra jo Allah key raaste mein bahey, do nishaniyon mein sey eik nishani wo hai jo Allah ki raah mein lagey aur dusri nishani wo hai jo Allah key faraaiz mein sey kisi fariza ki adaegi ki haalat mein lagey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"1721","As-Sa'ib bin Yazid (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \jb rswl allh ﷺ tbwk say waps tshryf layay...\"""""""
"1722","Hazrat Umar bin Al-Khattab (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke: \Banu An-Nadir ka maal un ghanimat mein se tha jo Allah Ta'ala ne apne Rasool (ﷺ) par nuzul farmaya tha"","" jise musalmanon ne na apne ghodon ki daud se hasil kiya tha na un ke oonton ki. Pas yeh maal khaas taur par Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke liye tha.\"""""""
"1723","Abu Musa Al-Ash'ari (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Meri Ummat ke mardon ke liye resham aur sona haram kar diya gaya hai aur unki auraton ke liye halal rakha gaya hai.\"" [Abu 'Eisa (رحمه الله) ne kaha: Is mazmoon par Umar (رضي الله عنه) se bhi rivayatain hain.]"""""
"1724","Suwayd bin Ghafalah ne riwayat kiya ke 'Umar (radiyallahu 'anhu) ne Al-Jabiyah mein khutbah irshad farmaya aur farmaya: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne resham (silk) mana farmaya hai siwaye do ungliyon (fingers) ke barabar ki jagah ke.\"""""""
"1725","Anas bin Malik (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh abdalrhmn bn awf (rz all anh) awr zbyr bn awam (rz all anh) nay ayk jng kay dwran jw an myn say anhwn nay rswl allh (ﷺ) kw jwon ky shkayt ky۔ aap (ﷺ) nay anhyn ryshmy qmys phnnay ky ajthad dy۔ anhwn nay kha: \myn nay an kw wh phnay hwyay dykha۔\"" [abw aysyٰ nay kha:] yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔"""""
"1726","Hazrat Waqid bin Amr bin Sa'd bin Mu'adh (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki:\n\n\Jab Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) aaye"","" to main unke paas gaya. Unhon ne poocha: 'Tum kaun ho?' Maine kaha: 'Main Waqid bin Amr bin Sa'd bin Mu'adh hoon.' Jab unhone yeh suna"","" to woh rote hue kehne lage: 'Tum Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se bahut milte julte ho. Aur Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) logon mein se sab se bare logon mein se the.'\"""""""
"1727","Al-Bara' (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke siwa kisi aise shakhs ko jis ke baal kandhon se neeche tak aur jo ek surkh Hullah (jora) pehne ho"","" zyada khoobsurat nahi dekha. Aap (ﷺ) ke baal kandhon par phailte hue the."""""
"1728","Hazrat Ali (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ne Al-Qassi ke libas aur Usfar se rang karne par mana farmaya hai. [Abu Eisa ne farmaya:] Is mazmoon par Anas (R.A) aur Abdullah bin Amr (R.A) ki bhi riwayatein hain."
"1729","Salman (rzy allh anh) khtay hyn kh: \rswl allh (ﷺ) say chrby kay baray myn swal kya gya۔\"""""""
"1730","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai: \Ek bakri mar gayi"","" to Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne uske maalik se farmaya: 'Tum us ki kyun nahi utaar dete?'\"""""""
"1731","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jo bhi chamra dho diya jaye to...\"""""""
"1732","Hazrat Abdullah bin Ukaim (rzy allh anh) ky rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) ky trf say ayk kht aaya kh: \mrda janwrw ky khal astamal nh krw.\"""""""
"1733","Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (رضی اللہ عنہما) نے روایت کی کہ رسول اللہ (ﷺ) نے فرمایا: \یوم قیامت میں...\"""""""
"1734","Ibn Umar (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat karte hain ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Jis shakhs ne apna libaas ghurur se zameen tak kheench kar chala...\"""""""
"1735","Umm Salamah (رضي الله عنha) ne riwayat kiya ke: \Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne Fatimah (رضي الله عنha) ka libaas ek haath (hand-span) tak dheela kar diya.\"" [Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne farmaya:] Baaz logon ne is riwayat ko Hammad bin Salamah (رحمه الله) se naql kiya hai."""""
"1736","Abu Burdah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Aisha (رضي الله عنها) ne ek rafoo shuda oon ka kisa (chadar) liya."
"1737","Ibn Mas'ud (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jis din uske Rab ne us se kalaam kiya...\"""""""
"1738","Muḥammad ibn ʿUmar ibn ʿAlī al-Muqaddamī al-Baṣrī ne ham se riwāyat bayaan kī, mere wālid ne mujh se riwāyat kī, Sufyān ibn Ḥusayn se, ʿUbayd Allāh ibn ʿUmar se, Nāfiʿ se, aur Ibn ʿUmar (raḍiya Allāhu ʿanhumā) se, unhone farmāyā: \Main ne yaqīnan dekhā ki Ḥunayn ke din jab dono giroh bhāg rahe the aur Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ke sāth sī men se bhī kam ādmī na the.\"" Abū ʿĪsā ne farmāyā: \""Yeh ḥasan"","" ṣaḥīḥ aur gharīb ḥadīth hai; ʿUbayd Allāh ki ḥadīth se is silsile ke siwā ise ham nahīm jānte.\"""""""
"1739","Nafi' ne riwayat karte hain ke Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) ne farmaya: \Jab Rasool Allah (ﷺ) Imamah (pagri) bandhte to unke kandhon ke darmiyan latka dete.\"" Nafi' ne kaha: \""Ibn 'Uram (رضي الله عنhma) bhi apna Imamah apne kandhon ke darmiyan latka dete the.\"" Ubaidullah ne kaha: \""Aur maine Al-Qasim aur Salim ko bhi yahi amal karte dekha.\"" [Abu 'Eisa ne kaha:] Ye Hadith Hasan Gharib hai. Aur is mazmoon par 'Ali (رضي الله عنہ) ki bhi riwayat hai. Lekin 'Ali (رضي الله"""""
"1740","Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (rzy allh anh) nay rwayt kya kh: \rswl allh (ﷺ) nay mjhay swnay ky angwthywn say mna frma dya۔\"""""""
"1741","Imran bin Husain (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay hmyn swnay ky angwthy phnnay say mna frmaya\n\n(rawy nay kha:) as mwzwa pr aly (rz all anh) say bhy rwayat hyn۔"
"1742","Anas (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke: \Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne ek angoothi banaayi jo chandi ki thi aur uska pathar (fass) Habshi tha.\"" Unhon ne kaha ke is mauzoo par Ibn Umar (رضي الله عنهما) aur Buraidah (رضي الله عنہ) se bhi rivaayatain hain. [Abu Eisa (رحمة الله"""""
"1743","Hazrat Anas (Razi Allahu Anho) ne bayan farmaya ke: \Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka angushtree kaan ka silaah tha.\"""""""""""""
"1744","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke liye ek sone ki anguthhi banwayi gayi, jise woh apne dahine haath pehna karte the. Phir woh Mimbar par baithe aur farmaya: \Maine yeh anguthhi apne haath mein rakhi thi.\"" Phir unhone use phenk diya aur logon ne bhi apni anguthhiyan phenk diyan.\n\nIs mazmoon par Ali (رضي الله عنهم) se bhi riwayatein hain."""""
"1745","As-Salt bin Abdullah bin Nawfal ne riwayat ki: \Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنہما) ne apne dahinہ haath mein angushtrī (ring) pehni thi. Aur mujhe koi shak nahi ke unhone kaha: 'Maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko apne dahinہ haath mein angushtrī pehnte dekhi.'\""""\n\n[Abu Eisa (رحمة الله علیہ) ne farmaya:] Muhammad bin Isma'il ne kaha: \""""Yeh Hadith Muhammad bin Iqaas se As-Salt bin Abdullah bin Nawfal ki riwayat par mabni hai"""","""" aur yeh ek Hasan Sahih Hadith hai.\""""\n\n"
"1746","Ja'far bin Muhammad ne apni se riwayat ki, unke baap ne farmaya: \Al-Hasan aur Al-Husain ne apni angusht (ring) baayein haath pehna tha.\"" Ye Hadith Hasan Sahih hai."""""
"1747","Hammad bin Salamah ne riwayat ki: \Maine Ibn Rafi' ko dekha [aur woh 'Ubaidullah bin Abi Rafi' hain]"""""
"1748","\Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne ek anguthi banwayi jo chandi (silver) ki thi.\"""""""""""""
"1749","Hazrat Anas (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay: \jb rswl allh ﷺ as jgh myn dakhl hwtay jhan wh apnay zrwry kam (qzayay hajt) kay lyay jatay thay...\"""""""""""""
"1750","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: nby krym (ﷺ) ky angwthy ky nqshy tyn laynwn myn thy: ayk layn pr \mhmd\"" tha۔"""""
"1751","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنهم) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ki angushtri (ring) par teenon parchein (lines) mein kuch tha: ek parche mein \Muhammad\"" tha."""""
"1752","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne ghar mein tasweeron (images) rakhne se mana farmaya.\"""""""
"1753","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''sab sey behtar chiz jis sey baal ki safedi badli jaey wo mehndi aur vasma hai.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1754","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jo shakhs koi tasweer banaye...\"""""""
"1755","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Badal do baalon ko (safed rang se).\"""""""
"1756","Abu Dharr (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hain ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Beshak baalon ke safed hone ke liye sab se behtar cheez Henna aur Katam hai.\"" [Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne kaha:] Ye Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Is sanad mein Abu Al-Aswad Ad-Dili ka naam Zalim bin Amr bin Sufyan hai."""""
"1757","\Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ka qaadam darmiyaney qad ke the.\"""""""""""""
"1758","Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allah Anha) ne bayan farmaya: \Main aur Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasalamm) ek hi bartan se ghusl karte the. Unke baal kandhon se zyada aur kanon ke lobon se kam tak pahunchte the.\"" Ye hadith Hasan Sahih Gharib hai. [Abu Isa (Rahmatullah Alaih) ne farmaya:] Is hadith ke doosre riwayaton mein bhi Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allah Anha) se manqool hai ke: \""Main aur Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasalamm) ek hi bartan se ghusl karte the.\"" Lekin is riwayat mein ye jumla mazkour nahi hai: \""Unke baal kandhon se zyada aur kanon ke lobon se kam tak pahunchte the.\"" Ye sirf Abdur Rahman bin Abi Az-Zinad ne zikr kiya hai."""""
"1759","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne do qismon ke libaas se mana farmaya: As-Sama' (wo libaas jis mein aadmi ek taraf se sharm ke baghair nange ho jaye) aur Ihtiba' (baithne ka ek aisa tarika jis mein aadmi ek taraf se nange ho jaye)."
"1760","Hazrat Ibn 'Umar (rzy allh anhma) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \allh taalyٰ nay balwn kw twyl krnay waly awr apnay balwn kw twyl krwayay janay waly awrt pr lant bhyjy hay۔\"""""""
"1761","Al-Bara' bin 'Azib (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Miyathir (ek qism ki chamraayi ya reshami chadar) par sawaari karne se mana' farmaya. [Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne farmaya:] Is mauzoo' par Ali (رضي الله عنhu) aur Mu'awiyah (رضي الله عنhu) ki bhi riwayaat hain. Al-Bara' ki hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Shu'bah (رحمه الله) ne Ash'ath bin Abi Ash-Sha'tha' (رحمه"
"1762","Aisha (Razi Allah Unha) ne riwayat farmaya ke: \Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ka woh iksaar jo woh sote the"","" woh chamre ka tha jismein khoor bharey huay thay.\"" [Abu Eisa (Rahmatullah Alaih) ne farmaya:] Ye Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Unhon ne farmaya: Is mawdo par Hafsa (Razi Allah Unha) aur Jabir (Razi Allah Unha) ki bhi riwayatein hain."""""
"1763","Umm Salamah (Razi Allah Anha) se riwayat hai ke: \Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ko sab se zyada pasand tha Qamis (lamba kameez).\"" [Abu Eisa ne farmaya:] Ye Hadith Hasan Gharib hai. Hum is sirf Abdul-Mu'min bin Khalid (is Hadith ke sanad mein ek rawi) ki riwayat ke taur par jaante hain"","" jo ise tanha rawayat kar rahe the."""""
"1764","Umm Salamah (Razi Allah Anha) ne riwayat farmaya: \Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ko sab se zyada pasand tha Qamis (lambai dar qameez).\"""""""
"1765","Umm Salamah (rz all anha) say rwayt hay: \rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) kw sb say zyadh psndydh lbas qmys (lmby qmys) tha۔\"""""""
"1766","Asma' bint Yazid bin As-Sakan Al-Ansariyyah (رضي الله عنها) ne riwayat farmaya: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke qamees ke asteen tak thi.\"" [Abu 'Eisa (رحمه"""""
"1767","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke: \Jab Rasoolullah (ﷺ) Qamis (qamees) pehne to woh (ﷺ) dahine (right) taraf se shuru karte the.\"" [Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne farmaya: Is hadith ko Shu'bah (رحمه"""""
"1768","Urwah bin Mugheerah bin Shu'bah (rz all anhma) nay apnay bap say rwayt ky kh nby krym ﷺ nay ayk rwmy jbh phn rkha tha js ky aastynyn tng thyn\n\nabw aysyٰ (rhmh allh) nay frmaya: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔"
"1769","Ash-Sha'bi ne riwayat ki: Al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah (رضي الله عنہ) se: \Dihyah Al-Kalbi (رضي الله"""""""""
"1770","Abu Al-Malih (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ ne sher-dil (predator) ki khaloos (skins) se mana farmaya. Aur yeh sanad (chain) zyada sahih hai."
"1771","Ibn Abi 'Umar ne hamaare paas rivaayat kiya: Sufyaan ibn 'Uyaynah ne hamaare paas rivaayat kiya, 'Amr ibn Dinar se, Ibn Shihaab se, 'Umar ibn Aws ibn al-Hadithan se, unhone kaha: Maine 'Umar ibn al-Khattab (rad) ko suna: Banu al-Nadir ke maal, Allah ne apne Rasool (saw) ko diya, jis ke liye muslimeen ko asbabe sawaar karne ki zaroorat nahi thi. Ye maal khaas Rasool Allah (saw) ke liye tha. Woh apne parivaar ke liye ek saal ka provisions rakhte the, aur baqi maal ko Allah ki raah ke liye asbabe jihhaad mein lagaate the. Abu 'Isa ne kaha: Ye hasan sahih hadith hai. Sufyaan ibn 'Uyaynah ne ye hadith Ma'mar se, Ibn Shihaab se rivaayat ki."
"1772","Urwah bin Mugirah bin Shu'bah (rz all anh) nay apnay wald (rz all anh) say rwayt ky kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay ayk rwmy jbh phn rkha tha js ky aastynyn tng thyn\n\nabw aysyٰ (rhmh allh) nay frmaya: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔"
"1773","Hazrat Ash-Sha'bi ne riwayat ki, Hazrat Mughirah bin Shu'bah (رضي الله عنه) se: \Hazrat Dihyah Al-Kalbi (رضي الله عنه) ne Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko do jode Khuff (jutay) bheje.\"""""""
"1774","Anas ibn Malik (raziAllahu anhu) ne riwayat farmaya:\n\nAbdur-Rahman ibn Awf aur Az-Zubayr ibn Al-Awwam (raziAllahu anhuma) ne Nabi ﷺ ke paas ek ghazwa (military expedition) ke darmiyan joon (lice) ki takleef ki shikayat ki. Aap ﷺ ne unhe resham ke qameez pehne ki ijazat de di. Anas (raziAllahu anhu) ne kaha: \Main ne unhe dekha ke woh (resham ke qameez) pehne hue the.\""""\n\nAbu Isa (At-Tirmidhi) ne farmaya: Ye ek *hasan sahih* hadith hai.\n\n\n\nSanad (Chain of Narration)\n\nMahmūd ibn Ghaylān ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki"""","""" Abdus-Samad ibn Abdul-Wārith ne riwayat ki"""","""" Hammām ne riwayat ki"""","""" Qatādah ne Anas ibn Mālik (raziAllahu anhu) se riwayat ki.\n\n\n\nUloom-e-Hadith ke Notes\n\nYe hadith Sunan At-Tirmidhi mein darj hai aur is se yeh hujjat milti hai ke haqeeqi medical zarurat (maslan"""","""" joon ki sakht infestation jo ek qism ya dard ya takleef hai) ki surat mein resham ke kapde pehne ki jaiz hai. Nabi ﷺ ne apni nabuwati ikhtiyar ka istemal karke in dono aziz Sahaba (raziAllahu anhuma) ko khaas ijazat (*rukhṣah*) di"""","""" jis se fiqhi misal qaaim ho gayi ke zarurat ke haal mein mard ke liye resham ki aam manahi ko waqt ke liye tal kar sakti hai. Anas ibn Malik (raziAllahu anhu) ki gawahi ke unhone khud unhe resham ke qameez pehnte dekha"""","""" ijazat ki tasdeeq karne ka saboot hai."""""""""
"1775","Hum is hadees ko sirf Abdur-Rahman bin Tarafah ki riwayat ke taur par jaante hain. Salm bin Zarir ne Abu Al-Ashhab ki riwayat ke muwafiq Abdur-Rahman bin Taraqah se mukhtasar riwayat ki hai - Abdur-Rahman bin Taraqah se. Ahl-e-ilm mein se aik se zyada sahaba ke baare mein yeh riwayat manqool hai ke woh apne daanton ko sehrate (gold se mazboot) karte the, aur is hadees mein unke liye daleel thi."
"1776","Zarir ka qaul ziyada sahi hai, aur Abu Sa'd As-San'ani (is silsile mein ek rawi) ka naam Muhammad bin Muyassir hai. \nJam' al-Tirmidhi, Hadees: 1770, Arabi Hadees: 1770."
"1777","Abu Al-Malih (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne sher (predator) ki khal se mana farmaya hai. Aur yeh silsila (chain) zyada sahih hai."
"1778","Qatadah ne riwayat ki: \Main ne Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) se poocha: 'Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke sandal kaisay thay?' Unhon ne farmaya: 'Un mein do patte thay.'\"""""""
"1779","Qatadah ne riwayat ki hai ke Anas (رضي الله عنہ) se: \Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke chappal mein do patte the.\"" [Abu Eisa (رحمت اللہ علیہ) ne kaha:] Ye Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Unhon ne kaha: Is mazmoon par Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنہ) se bhi riwayatein hain."""""
"1780","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah un par ho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ek hi joota peh kar mat chalna.\"""""""
"1781","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hain ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne is se mana farmaya ke koi shaksh khade ho kar joote (sandal) na pahenne. [Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne farmaya:] Ye hadees hasan gharib hai. Ubaidullah bin Amr Raqi (رحمه الله) ne ye hadees Ma'mar (رحمه الله) se riwayat ki hai."
"1782","\Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne is se mana farmaya ke koi shaksh khade ho kar joota (sandal) na pahne.\"""" [Abu Eisa (رحمت اللہ علیہ) ne farmaya:] Yee Hadees Gharib hai. Muhammad bin Isma'il (رحمت اللہ"""""""""
"1783","Hazrat Aishah (Razi Allahu Anha) ne bayan farmaya: \Kabhi Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallem) ek joote mein chalte thay.\"""""""
"1784","Ishaq ibn Mansur rivayat karte hain: Affan ne humein khabar di: Hammad ibn Salamah ne humein riwayat kiya, Ali ibn Zayd se, Umm al-Hasan al-Basriyyah se, ke Umm Salamah (Rivayat kiya ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne Fatimah (radiyallahu anha) ke liye apne nitaq (kadorsi) se ek shibr (haath ki vad) pāndhā.\n\nAbu Isa [al-Tirmidhi] farmayā: Aur baaz unho ne Hammad ibn Salamah se riwayat kiya, Ali ibn Zayd se, al-Hasan se, uski maan se, Umm Salamah (radiyallahu anha) se.\n\nAbu Isa ne yeh bhi farmaya: Is hadith mein auraton ke liye izār (neeche kapde) ko kheenchne (jar) ke baare mein rukhsah (chhoot) hai, kyunke unke liye isse ziyada satr (dhak) hota hai.\n\n\n\nDāniš Nōṭs:\n\n- شَبَّرَ (shabbara): Ayaat (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne shibr (haath ki vad) se pāndhā, iska matlab hai ke Ayaat (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne khaas taur par Fatimah (radiyallahu anha) ke liye apne nitaq (kadorsi) se ek shibr ki doori pāndhā, aur usko izāzat di us kapde ko us pāndh tak lāne ki.\n\n- نِطَاقِهَا (nitiqiha): Uska nitaq ya neeche ka kapda, jo us zamane mein auraton ke libās ka hissa tha.\n\n- رُخْصَةٌ (rukhsah): Islāmi fiqh mein rukhsah ya riyāyat, iska matlab hai ke izār ko kheenchne (jar) ke liye takabbur (khuyalā') ki haalat mein aam taur par manā hai, lekin auraton ko is mein istisnā diya gaya hai, kyunke ziyada lambā hona ziyada dhak aur satr ka kaam karta hai.\n\n- جَرِّ"
"1785","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jb tm myn say kwyy jwtay phnay"""""
"1786","Hazrat Aisha (rzy allh anha) nay rwayt ky kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay mjh say frmaya: \agr tm myray sath hw chky krna chahty hw tw"""""
"1787","Jābir (radiyallāhu ʿanhu) rivāyat karte hain:\n\nMuḥammad ibn Bashshār ne hamen batāyā, ʿAbd al-Raḥmān ibn Mahdī ne batāyā, Ḥammād ibn Salamah se, Abū al-Zubayr se, Jābir (radiyallāhu ʿanhu) se, unhone kathā:\n\n\Nabī (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) Yawm al-Fatḥ (Fateh Makkah) ko Makkah mein ek sīāh ʿimāmah (pagṛī) pehne hue dākhil hue.\""""\n\nUnhonne (rāwī) kathā: \""""Is bāb mein ʿAlī (radiyallāhu ʿanhu)"""","""" ʿAmr ibn Ḥurayth"""","""" Ibn ʿAbbās aur Rukānah (radiyallāhu ʿanhum) ki bhī rivāyāt hain.\""""\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (al-Tirmidhī"""","""" raḥimahullāh) ne farmāyā: \""""Jābir kā Ḥadīth ḥasan ṣaḥīḥ hai.\""""\n\n\n\n*Ye Ḥadīth Sunan al-Tirmidhī mein daraj hai aur is se Nabī Muḥammad (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ki shāna āyat ba Fatḥ Makkah ke aise azeem avasara par sāmne āti hai"""","""" jinhonne sīāh ʿimāmah pehna"""","""" jo Nabī (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ki mashtūr ʿādat hai.*"""""""""
